      "problem": "What is the trace in the $yz$-plane of the elliptic paraboloid $z=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{27}.$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $yz$-plane, we substitute $x=0$ into the equation of the paraboloid, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =\\frac{{0}^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{27} \\\\ z & =\\frac{1}{27}(y-1)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis gives us the equation of the parabola in $yz$-plane.",
